    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d626">

                <pb facs="0799" n="705" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg705"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Lee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1896-08-18"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                                18, 1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Newspaper advices from Key West of 16th state that Charles Govin, an American
                    citizen and correspondent, was captured near Jaruco by Spanish troops and put to
                    death. Investigate and report by cable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
